{"strongs": "H7161", "word": "קֶ֫רֶן", "translit": "qe.ren", "root": "קרן", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "horn", "definition": "קֶ֫רֶן 75 noun feminine Jer 48:25 horn ; — absolute ׳ ק Isa 5:1 +, קָ֑רֶן Ps 75:5 construct קֶ֫רֶן Josh 6:5 +; suffix קַרְנִי 1Sam 2:1 ; Ps 92:11 , etc.; dual קַרְנַיִם Hab 3:4 , קְרָנַיִם Dan 8:3 ; Dan 8:6 , נָ֑יִם - v Dan 8:3 v Dan 8:20 construct קַרְנֵי 1Kgs 22:11 +, suffix קַרְנָיו Gen 22:13 ; Deut 33:17 , קְרָנָיו Dan 8:7 , קַרְנֵיכֶם Ezek 34:21 plural (usually in derived senses) קְרָנוֺת Ezek 43:15 +; construct קַרְנֹת Exod 29:12 +, suffix קַרְנֹתָיו Exod 27:2 +, etc.; — horn: 1. a. of ram ( אַיִל ) Gen 22:13 , so in Daniel's vision Dan 8:3 (twice in verse); Dan 8:6 ; Dan 8:7 ; Dan 8:20 , and (of goat) v Dan 8:5 v Dan 8:8 v Dan 8:9 v Dan 8:21 of oppressors in Israel (under figure of rams) Ezek 34:21 , so of nations Zech 2:2 ; Zech 2:4 (3 t. in verse); of רְאֵם Deut 33:17 ; Ps 22:22 (both figurative, compare Ps 92:11 ); of Zion under figure of threshing-ox Mic 4:13 בַּרְזֶל ׳ ק 1Kgs 22:11 = 2Chr 18:10 (symbolic); seen in Zechariah's vision Zech 2:1 . \\ \\ b. used as oil-flask 1Sam 16:1 ; 1Sam 16:13 ; 1Kgs 1:39 (compare קֶרֶן הַפּוּח below). \\ \\ c. הַיּוֺבֵל ׳ ק , as wind-instrument Josh 6:5 (compare שׁוֺפָר ). \\ \\ d. קַרְנוֺת שֵׁן Ezek 27:15 (from curved shape of tusks). 2. figurative, of person, symbol of strength Deut 33:17 , יִשְׁעִי ׳ ק 2Sam 22:3 = Ps 18:3 (of ׳ י as deliverer); others below 3 or 4 ; especially as lifted up ( רום , as of a lordly animal, compare Dr 1Sam 2 . 1 ), denoting increase of might, dignity 1Sam 2:1 ; 1Sam 2:10 ; Lam 2:17 ; Ps 75:11 ; Ps 89:18 ; Ps 89:25 ; Ps 92:11 ; Ps 112:9 , so perhaps 1Chr 25:5 (see Kau ; > Be blow loudly [compare 1 c ]), + לְעַמּוֺ Ps 148:14 (subject ׳ י ); also haughtiness, arrogance Ps 75:5 ; Ps 75:6 opposed to ׳ גָּדַע ק hew off horns , i.e. reduce, humiliate, Lam 2:3 ; Ps 75:11 , passive Jer 48:25 , so וְעֹלַלְתִּי בֶעָפָר קַרְנִי Job 16:15 ׳ לְבֵית יִשׂ ׳ אַצְמִיהַ ק Ezek 29:21 is apparently of restoration of might (as Ps 148:14 above, with וַיָּרֶם ), but לְדָוִד ׳ ק ׳ אַצ Ps 132:17 of raising up individual ruler of Davidic line. 3. of altar, horn-like projections at corners (26 t.), Amos 3:14 ; Jer 17:1 ; Ezek 43:15 ; Ezek 43:20 ; Ps 118:27 ; Exod 27:22 + 8t. Exodus; Lev 4:7 ; Lev 4:18 + 6 t. Leviticus (all P ); as sanctuary, refuge 1Kgs 1:50 ; 1Kgs 1:51 ; 1Kgs 2:28 . 4. hill (so in Arabic, peak, isolated hill , compare Ges) Isa 5:1 . 5. קַרְנַיִם מִיָּדוֺ לוֺ Hab 3:4 rays at his side(s) had he (of lightning-flashes in theoph., compare Now Da ). — Amos 6:13 see קַדְנַיִם proper name, of a location", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7597')\">BDB7597</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7161')\">H7161</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7596')\">BDB7596</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7598')\">BDB7598</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>קֶ֫רֶן</bdbheb><sub>75</sub> <b>noun feminine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Jer 48:25\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,25)\">Jer 48:25</ref></sup> <highlightword>horn</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 5:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,1)\">Isa 5:1</ref> +, <bdbheb>קָ֑רֶן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 75:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"75\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"75\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,75,5)\">Ps 75:5</ref> construct <bdbheb>קֶ֫רֶן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 6:5\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(6,6,5)\">Josh 6:5</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>קַרְנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,1)\">1Sam 2:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 92:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"92\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"92\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,92,11)\">Ps 92:11</ref>, etc.; dual <bdbheb>קַרְנַיִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hab 3:4\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(35,3,4)\">Hab 3:4</ref>, <bdbheb>קְרָנַיִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 8:3\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,3)\">Dan 8:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 8:6\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,6)\">Dan 8:6</ref>, <bdbheb>נָ֑יִם</bdbheb>- v<ref ref=\"Dan 8:3\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,3)\">Dan 8:3</ref> v<ref ref=\"Dan 8:20\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,20)\">Dan 8:20</ref> construct <bdbheb>קַרְנֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:11\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,11)\">1Kgs 22:11</ref> +, suffix <bdbheb>קַרְנָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 22:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,22,13)\">Gen 22:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 33:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,17)\">Deut 33:17</ref>, <bdbheb>קְרָנָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 8:7\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,7)\">Dan 8:7</ref>, <bdbheb>קַרְנֵיכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 34:21\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(26,34,21)\">Ezek 34:21</ref> plural (usually in derived senses) <bdbheb>קְרָנוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 43:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,43,15)\">Ezek 43:15</ref> +; construct <bdbheb>קַרְנֹת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 29:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,12)\">Exod 29:12</ref> +, suffix <bdbheb>קַרְנֹתָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 27:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,2)\">Exod 27:2</ref> +, etc.; — <highlight>horn:</highlight> <div class=\"point\"><b>1. a.</b> <highlightword>of ram</highlightword> (<bdbheb>אַיִל</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Gen 22:13\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(1,22,13)\">Gen 22:13</ref>, so in Daniel's vision <ref ref=\"Dan 8:3\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,3)\">Dan 8:3</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Dan 8:6\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,6)\">Dan 8:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 8:7\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,7)\">Dan 8:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 8:20\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,20)\">Dan 8:20</ref>, and (of goat) v<ref ref=\"Dan 8:5\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,5)\">Dan 8:5</ref> v<ref ref=\"Dan 8:8\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,8)\">Dan 8:8</ref> v<ref ref=\"Dan 8:9\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,9)\">Dan 8:9</ref> v<ref ref=\"Dan 8:21\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(27,8,21)\">Dan 8:21</ref> of oppressors in Israel (under figure of rams) <ref ref=\"Ezek 34:21\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(26,34,21)\">Ezek 34:21</ref>, so of nations <ref ref=\"Zech 2:2\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(38,2,2)\">Zech 2:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 2:4\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(38,2,4)\">Zech 2:4</ref> (3 t. in verse); of <bdbheb>רְאֵם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 33:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,17)\">Deut 33:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 22:22\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(19,22,22)\">Ps 22:22</ref> (both figurative, compare <ref ref=\"Ps 92:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"92\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"92\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,92,11)\">Ps 92:11</ref>); of Zion under figure of threshing-ox <ref ref=\"Mic 4:13\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(33,4,13)\">Mic 4:13</ref> <bdbheb>בַּרְזֶל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:11\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,11)\">1Kgs 22:11</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 18:10\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(14,18,10)\">2Chr 18:10</ref> (symbolic); seen in Zechariah's vision <ref ref=\"Zech 2:1\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(38,2,1)\">Zech 2:1</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> used as oil-flask <ref ref=\"1Sam 16:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,16,1)\">1Sam 16:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 16:13\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(9,16,13)\">1Sam 16:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 1:39\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(11,1,39)\">1Kgs 1:39</ref> (compare <bdbheb>קֶרֶן הַפּוּח</bdbheb> below). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <bdbheb>הַיּוֺבֵל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb>, as wind-instrument <ref ref=\"Josh 6:5\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(6,6,5)\">Josh 6:5</ref> (compare <bdbheb>שׁוֺפָר</bdbheb>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> <bdbheb>קַרְנוֺת שֵׁן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 27:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,27,15)\">Ezek 27:15</ref> (from curved shape of tusks). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> figurative, of person, symbol of strength <ref ref=\"Deut 33:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,17)\">Deut 33:17</ref>, <bdbheb>יִשְׁעִי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:3\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,3)\">2Sam 22:3</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ps 18:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,3)\">Ps 18:3</ref> (of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> as deliverer); others below <b>3</b> or <b>4</b>; <highlightword>especially as lifted up</highlightword> (<bdbheb>רום</bdbheb>, as of a lordly animal, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup><ref ref=\"1Sam 2\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,1)\">1Sam 2</ref>. 1</sup></lookup>), denoting increase of might, dignity <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,1)\">1Sam 2:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:10\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,10)\">1Sam 2:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lam 2:17\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(25,2,17)\">Lam 2:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 75:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"75\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"75\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,75,11)\">Ps 75:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 89:18\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,18)\">Ps 89:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 89:25\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,25)\">Ps 89:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 92:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"92\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"92\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,92,11)\">Ps 92:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 112:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"112\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"112\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,112,9)\">Ps 112:9</ref>, so perhaps <ref ref=\"1Chr 25:5\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(13,25,5)\">1Chr 25:5</ref> (see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kau')\">Kau</lookup>; &gt; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Be')\">Be</lookup> <highlight>blow loudly</highlight> [compare <b>1 c</b>]), + <bdbheb>לְעַמּוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 148:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"148\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"148\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,148,14)\">Ps 148:14</ref> (subject <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>); also haughtiness, arrogance <ref ref=\"Ps 75:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"75\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"75\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,75,5)\">Ps 75:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 75:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"75\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"75\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,75,6)\">Ps 75:6</ref> opposed to <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>גָּדַע ק</bdbheb> <highlight>hew off horns</highlight>, i.e. reduce, humiliate, <ref ref=\"Lam 2:3\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(25,2,3)\">Lam 2:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 75:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"75\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"75\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,75,11)\">Ps 75:11</ref>, passive <ref ref=\"Jer 48:25\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,25)\">Jer 48:25</ref>, so <bdbheb>וְעֹלַלְתִּי בֶעָפָר קַרְנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 16:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,16,15)\">Job 16:15</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְבֵית יִשׂ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אַצְמִיהַ ק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 29:21\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(26,29,21)\">Ezek 29:21</ref> is apparently of restoration of might (as <ref ref=\"Ps 148:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"148\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"148\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,148,14)\">Ps 148:14</ref> above, with <bdbheb>וַיָּרֶם</bdbheb>), but <bdbheb>לְדָוִד</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אַצ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 132:17\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"132\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"132\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(19,132,17)\">Ps 132:17</ref> of raising up individual ruler of Davidic line. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> of altar, horn-like projections at corners (26 t.), <ref ref=\"Amos 3:14\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(30,3,14)\">Amos 3:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 17:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,1)\">Jer 17:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 43:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,43,15)\">Ezek 43:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 43:20\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(26,43,20)\">Ezek 43:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 118:27\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"118\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"118\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(19,118,27)\">Ps 118:27</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Exod 27:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,22)\">Exod 27:22</ref> + 8t. Exodus; <ref ref=\"Lev 4:7\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(3,4,7)\">Lev 4:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 4:18\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(3,4,18)\">Lev 4:18</ref> + 6 t. Leviticus (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); as sanctuary, refuge <ref ref=\"1Kgs 1:50\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"50\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"50\" onclick=\"bcv(11,1,50)\">1Kgs 1:50</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 1:51\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"51\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"51\" onclick=\"bcv(11,1,51)\">1Kgs 1:51</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 2:28\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(11,2,28)\">1Kgs 2:28</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>hill</highlight> (so in Arabic, <highlight>peak, isolated hill</highlight>, compare Ges) <ref ref=\"Isa 5:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,1)\">Isa 5:1</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <bdbheb>קַרְנַיִם מִיָּדוֺ לוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hab 3:4\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(35,3,4)\">Hab 3:4</ref> <highlight>rays at his side(s) had he</highlight> (of lightning-flashes in theoph., compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Da')\">Da</lookup>). — <ref ref=\"Amos 6:13\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(30,6,13)\">Amos 6:13</ref> see <bdbh